= Arkadi Maslow

Born Isaak Tschemerinski in Yelisavetgrad, raised in Germany, once a concert pianist and a student of Einstein's. Ruth Fischer's partner and the Left's sharpest mind. He knows the Russian party from the inside and believes the German revolution is a matter of will.

